abstract: "Software and data-science part of CrashGuard: severity estimation from clipped crash pulses, a compact crash detector, a LoRa alert-delivery simulator, a protocol model check and a duplicate audit. The code is Apache-2.0. Data derived from VZCrash are CC BY-NC 4.0."
